WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Artesano Cafeteria, brand identity, 2026. The logo only existed as a JPG.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
Starting point: rough edges, a fake transparent background, and wheat that turned into a smudge at small sizes.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.000
The question: clean up the old seal, or start again? The café was new, so there was no history to keep.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
The mark: wheat, a cup and three arcs. Symbol options generated with AI; I chose one and finished it by hand in Figma.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
One signature, three uses: main, negative and symbol.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Two colors: coffee brown and white, so it prints in one color, even on kraft paper.

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
Type: Garamond for the name, Montserrat for the rest.

00:35.000 --> 00:41.000
Applications: cups, bags and boxes. Mockups generated with AI, for illustration only.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.500
Approved by the client the next day. A 14-page brand guide, 4 logo files and a presentation film.
